    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Luis Robert Jr.** serving as our primary offensive engine, boasting a team-high efficiency score of 77.40. His matchup against Bennett is the highlight of our lineup; the combination of a favorable hitter\u2019s park and a dynamic platoon advantage against the lefty creates a massive ceiling. Furthermore, the slow delivery metrics from the opposing mound inflate the stolen base projection, a critical factor for our pursuit of category scarcity. Similarly, **Coby Mayo** (65.57) and **Gunnar Henderson** (62.67) benefit significantly from the environment against Bennett, though **Gunnar Henderson** faces a slight regression in his score due to the platoon adjustment against a southpaw. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** remains a high-floor start at 64.99; while he faces a right-handed matchup, his raw output against Bibee\u2019s 4.40 xERA keeps him firmly in the \"Strong\" start tier.\n\nThe most notable tactical decision involves the stability of our middle infield and outfield anchors. **Sam Antonacci** (61.20) secures the lead-off spot against Brown, where his base projection is bolstered by an ideal order position and favorable SP skills. **Kyle Tucker** (63.67) remains a reliable anchor despite a suboptimal spot in the batting order, as his elite base efficiency overrides the drop-off from hitting seventh. **Miguel Vargas** (52.92) rounds out the starting group; while his score is the most \"marginal\" of the active unit, his strong xwOBA against Brown provides sufficient confidence to bypass our bench options. With **Jackson Merrill** sidelined by a schedule gap and both **Andy Pages** and **Jordan Westburg** currently occupying IL slots, our depth is strained, forcing us to rely on our starters' individual efficiency scores rather than aggressive platooning. We are monitoring all lineups closely for late-scratch risks, particularly regarding **Gunnar Henderson** and **Coby Mayo**, but given the favorable pitcher matchups across the board, the current configuration offers the optimal balance between high-end production and protected game caps.",
